# This repository vendors third-party pack sources verbatim, so an ignore rule
# here can silently drop code the conversion is supposed to operate on. Only
# patterns that are editor or tool droppings are listed — nothing that a pack
# might legitimately ship.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, despite being usual entries elsewhere:
#   dist/    two packs declare `WEB_DIRECTORY = "./dist"` and serve their
#            frontend JS from it
#   build/   absent today, and the same risk as dist/ if a pack adopts it
#   scripts/ two packs declare `WEB_DIRECTORY = "./scripts"`

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors — present in several vendored packs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Python — packs are Python, and importing them during conversion or testing
# writes caches straight into the pack tree
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Node — packs that build their frontend assets
node_modules/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
